
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Network Security Monitoring Lab</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#0b1120;color:#e5edf8;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:24px;background:#111c30;border-bottom:1px solid #263750}
header h1{margin:0;color:#38bdf8;font-size:25px}
header p{color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:0}
.container{padding:20px;max-width:1200px;margin:auto}
.notice{background:#422006;color:#fde68a;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:15px}
.card{background:#142238;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #263750}
.card h3{font-size:14px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:0}
.number{font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;color:#38bdf8}
.section{margin-top:30px}
.section h2{color:#38bdf8}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#142238;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:13px;border-bottom:1px solid #263750;font-size:14px}
th{color:#94a3b8}
.status{color:#4ade80}
.warning{color:#fbbf24}
.danger{color:#fb7185}
footer{text-align:center;color:#64748b;padding:30px}
button{background:#0284c7;color:white;border:0;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>🛡️ Network Security Monitoring Lab</h1>
<p>Network Infrastructure | Firewall | IDS | Security Operations</p>
</header>

<main class="container">
<div class="notice">
<strong>DEMO MODE:</strong> All displayed monitoring data is simulated.
This dashboard is not connected to real network devices.
</div>

<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h3>Network Status</h3>
<div class="number status">ONLINE</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Connected Devices</h3>
<div class="number">48</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Active Alerts</h3>
<div class="number warning" id="alerts">3</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Blocked Connections</h3>
<div class="number danger">127</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>📡 Network Infrastructure</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Device</th><th>Type</th><th>Status</th><th>Location</th></tr>
<tr><td>MikroTik Router</td><td>Router</td><td class="status">Online</td><td>Building 1</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cisco Switch</td><td>Switch</td><td class="status">Online</td><td>Building 2</td></tr>
<tr><td>Firewall</td><td>Security</td><td class="status">Active</td><td>Main Office</td></tr>
<tr><td>IDS Sensor</td><td>Suricata IDS</td><td class="status">Running (Demo)</td><td>Monitoring Lab</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>🚨 Security Events</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Event</th><th>Source</th><th>Severity</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Multiple failed login attempts</td><td>192.0.2.10</td><td class="danger">High</td><td>Blocked (Demo)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Port scan detected</td><td>198.51.100.20</td><td class="warning">Medium</td><td>Investigating (Demo)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Unusual traffic detected</td><td>203.0.113.15</td><td class="warning">Medium</td><td>Monitoring (Demo)</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>🔧 Lab Technologies</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">MikroTik RouterOS</div>
<div class="card">Cisco Networking</div>
<div class="card">VLAN & ACL</div>
<div class="card">Firewall Security</div>
<div class="card">Suricata IDS</div>
<div class="card">Zabbix Monitoring</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="section">
<h2>📊 Lab Information</h2>
<p>Project: Network Security Monitoring Lab</p>
<p>Environment: Simulated Demonstration</p>
<p>Future Integration: MikroTik, Cisco, Suricata and Zabbix</p>
</div>
</main>

<footer>Network Security Monitoring Lab | Portfolio Project</footer>
</body>
</html>
